title AVG-05 Update a Live Service in AVG · PRD 2.5 BR-11, 2.6 BR-10 · US-06U
participant Maker_or_Client_Admin
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant DNS_Resolver
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant AVG
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_HSM
participant Zetrix_Registry
participant OpenAgenet
==SUBMIT UPDATE==
Maker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:submit update (changed fields, higher version)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:validate fields; version > current; type unchanged; no other pending update
alt ENDPOINT DOMAIN CHANGED
Admin_Portal_Backend->DNS_Resolver:check TXT record on new domain
DNS_Resolver-->Admin_Portal_Backend:found
end
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Maker_or_Client_Admin:update pending approval; service keeps running on current details
==APPROVE UPDATE==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:approve update
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:approver is not submitter
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:update registration (credential, claims, callback)
AVG-->Admin_Portal_Backend:ok (API key, secret, did:zid, did:oan unchanged)
alt SERVICE NAME OR ENDPOINT DOMAIN CHANGED
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:issue new Service Cert, revoke old
SSIVC->MBI:issue new VC, revoke old VC
MBI-->SSIVC:new Service Cert ID
SSIVC-->Admin_Portal_Backend:new Service Cert ID
end
Admin_Portal_Backend->Zetrix_Registry:update listing (new version)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Zetrix_HSM:sign new DID document version with did:oan key
Zetrix_HSM-->Admin_Portal_Backend:proof
Admin_Portal_Backend->OpenAgenet:submit new package version (async, retry)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:update live
alt UPDATE REJECTED
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Maker_or_Client_Admin:rejected with reason; service unchanged
end
